<title>USA: Comdisco delivers reconditioned equipment.</title>
<headline>Comdisco delivers reconditioned equipment.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comdisco Inc said Wednesday its Comdisco Healthcare Group delivered and installed its first reconditioned imaging system under a contract with the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs.</p>
<p>The cardiac catheterization laboratory system was placed in a VA Medical Center in Buffalo, N.Y., Comdisco said, at a savings of more than $600,000. The company currently has the opportunity to provide equipment to any government agency as part of a basic ordering agreement, Comdisco said.</p>
<p>Comdisco is a technology services company.</p>
<p>Its stock was trading down 1/8 Wednesday at 31-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
